BetterBacoor license index

New original software contributions, starting with the commit introducing this
policy, are offered under the MIT License in LICENSE-MIT.

Earlier original project material released under CC0, including such material
in commit 4aa4b533d643f9825a1068005370618d351d0601 and earlier releases,
retains its CC0 permissions. The inherited BetterLocalGov dedication is
preserved unchanged in LICENSE-CC0. MIT does not impose new conditions on
unchanged CC0 material.

Original non-software civic content continues under CC0 where contributors
hold the relevant rights. External documents, images, data, dependencies,
and other third-party material retain their original terms.

See docs/LICENSING.md for scope and ACKNOWLEDGMENTS.md for provenance.
